<title>HONG KONG: No plan to inject HKTel shrs into units - Everbright.</title>
<headline>No plan to inject HKTel shrs into units - Everbright.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>China Everbright Holdings Company Ltd said on Wednesday it had no intention of injecting its Hong Kong Telecommunications Ltd shareholding into any of its listed units.</p>
</text>
